0:{"buildId":"T8GTuy6XzRhHdsvq0NCF-","rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[[["$","div",null,{"className":"sm-mb-50 commonBanner2-module__m8QleG__commonbanner2","style":{"--bg":"url(/_next/static/media/e-commerce-dev.2ed7e884.webp) no-repeat center center / cover"},"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"frame-1200 py-100 sm-pt-0 sm-pb-10 sm-px-20 commonBanner2-module__m8QleG__content","children":[["$","h2",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"Ecommerce Website Development for <br/> Businesses in Dubai & the UAE"}}],["$","p",null,{"className":"my-30","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"Build scalable, user-friendly, and revenue-driven online stores with Website Development Agency.</br> We are the top-rated E-commerce web design & development agency in Dubai & the UAE."}}],["$","$L2",null,{"href":"/contact-us","className":"blue-btn","children":"Get a Free Consultation"}]]}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"frame-1200 py-100 sm-pt-0 sm-pb-50 sm-px-20","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Ecommerce Web Development in Dubai"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"commonIntroduction-module__IKzCgq__flex","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"commonIntroduction-module__IKzCgq__box","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"commonIntroduction-module__IKzCgq__gapcontent","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":" <p>The online retail sector in the UAE is booming as recent reports indicate that online sales in the region surpassed $17 billion in 2026, and aided by a tech-savvy and convenience-driven population. The UAE has reached a mobile-first ecommerce economy, with 98% internet penetration and practically every adult possessing a smartphone. </p>\n                    <p>The shopper experience in the UAE is more than simple online shopping- it demands smarter online shopping. Shoppers want fast-loading websites, secure methods of payment, and the option to choose different languages, currencies, and seamless product delivery. Companies that don’t provide these simple shopping experiences will quickly lose out to competitors offering these experiences. </p>\n                    "}}],["$","$L3",null,{"src":{"src":"/_next/static/media/introimg-1.587a19d7.webp","width":1256,"height":664,"blurWidth":8,"blurHeight":4,"blurDataURL":"data:image/webp;base64,"},"alt":"introimg-1"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"commonIntroduction-module__IKzCgq__box","children":[["$","$L3",null,{"src":{"src":"/_next/static/media/introimg-2.a0cf8a18.webp","width":1256,"height":716,"blurWidth":8,"blurHeight":5,"blurDataURL":"data:image/webp;base64,"},"alt":"introimg-1"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"commonIntroduction-module__IKzCgq__gapcontent","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"  <p>While solutions such as <a href=\"/platforms/shopify-website-development\">Shopify</a>, <a href=\"/platforms/woo-commerce-website-development\">WooCommerce</a>, or Magento provide easy-to-manage ecommerce set up, at the end of the day, the vast majority of DIY stores don’t provide the customization, scalability, or security that a business really needs. Stores using templates may look reasonable, they rarely represent a brand and fail when it gets complicated - managing thousands of SKUs, logistics development, or more complex multi-currency payments, for example, really needs a custom ecommerce development solution. </p>\n                <p>At <a href=\"/\">Website Development Agency</a>, we understand the unique needs of UAE businesses. From integrating local payment gateways to creating bilingual websites in Arabic and English, we build platforms designed for growth in one of the world’s most dynamic ecommerce landscapes.</p>\n                    "}}]]}]]}]]}],"$L4","$L5","$L6","$L7","$L8","$L9","$La","$Lb","$Lc","$Ld","$Le","$Lf"],["$L10","$L11","$L12","$L13"],"$L14"]}],"loading":null,"isPartial":false}
4:[["$","div",null,{"className":"frame-1200 pt-100 pb-40 sm-pt-0 sm-pb-30 sm-px-20","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"commonWhyMetter-module__UOAHbG__flex","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"commonWhyMetter-module__UOAHbG__left","children":"Why Ecommerce Website Development Matters in UAE"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"commonWhyMetter-module__UOAHbG__right","children":"In the UAE, Ecommerce has quickly changed from a luxury to a necessity in daily life. With an innovative population, one of the highest smartphone penetration rates worldwide, it is easy to see how the UAE has become a regional center of online business. Today, consumers are not just searching online, they are shopping online."}]]}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"pb-300 sm-pb-50 sm-px-20 commonWhyMetter-module__UOAHbG__whymetterbg","children":[["$","$L3",null,{"src":"/_next/static/media/whymetterbg.65c2b8c9.webp","alt":"Why Website Development","width":1200,"height":500}],["$","div",null,{"className":"commonWhyMetter-module__UOAHbG__absolute","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"commonWhyMetter-module__UOAHbG__flex commonWhyMetter-module__UOAHbG__endalign","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"commonWhyMetter-module__UOAHbG__left","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"commonWhyMetter-module__UOAHbG__background","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"  <p>Having an e-commerce website is essential for any business in Dubai looking to grow in today’s digital age. It allows you to reach a wider audience beyond your physical store, enabling customers across the UAE and even globally to discover and purchase your products. With a professional online store, your business is open 24/7, letting customers shop at their convenience and boosting sales around the clock.</p>\n                        <p>But here’s the truth: not all ecommerce websites succeed. Many companies fall into the trap of cookie-cutter templates or DIY platforms because they believe that building an online store is as simple as that. The result? The result is an identical, slow-loading website that does not convert visitors to paying customers.</p>\n                        "}}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"commonWhyMetter-module__UOAHbG__right","children":["$","p",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>As many companies turn to quick fixes for their e-commerce store, this is where Website Development Agency steps in. We are your e-commerce website development agency in Dubai & the UAE. Our in-house team combines creative and technical skills with market needs to deliver ecommerce website builds that are visually engaging, mobile-first, and conversion-driven.</p>\n                            "}}]}]]}]}]]}]]
5:["$","$L15",null,{"heading":"E-commerce Website Templates & Custom Designs","description":"Discover our high-performing e-commerce templated solutions or start with custom design. From fashion boutiques to electronics marketplaces, we build e-commerce websites for maximize sales and user engagement.","portfolioData":[{"subtitle":"All-Purpose E-commerce","image":{"src":"/_next/static/media/e-com-1.d0b5deac.webp","width":1080,"height":1920,"blurWidth":5,"blurHeight":8,"blurDataURL":"data:image/webp;base64,"},"link":"/contact-us","price":"AED 8,000"},{"subtitle":"Grocery & Organic Food","image":{"src":"/_next/static/media/e-com-2.fa13d0da.webp","width":1080,"height":1920,"blurWidth":5,"blurHeight":8,"blurDataURL":"data:image/webp;base64,"},"link":"/contact-us","price":"AED 8,000"},{"subtitle":"Fashion & Apparel Store","image":{"src":"/_next/static/media/e-com-3.9b9fb82c.webp","width":1080,"height":1920,"blurWidth":5,"blurHeight":8,"blurDataURL":"data:image/webp;base64,"},"link":"/contact-us","price":"AED 8,000"},{"subtitle":"Electronics E-commerce","image":{"src":"/_next/static/media/e-com-4.c7c513f7.webp","width":1080,"height":1920,"blurWidth":5,"blurHeight":8,"blurDataURL":"data:image/webp;base64,"},"link":"/contact-us","price":"AED 8,000"},{"subtitle":"Electronics E-commerce","image":{"src":"/_next/static/media/e-com-5.294fe9b1.webp","width":1080,"height":1920,"blurWidth":5,"blurHeight":8,"blurDataURL":"data:image/webp;base64,"},"link":"/contact-us","price":"AED 8,000"},{"subtitle":"All-Purpose E-commerce","image":{"src":"/_next/static/media/e-com-6.04983929.webp","width":1080,"height":1920,"blurWidth":5,"blurHeight":8,"blurDataURL":"data:image/webp;base64,"},"link":"/contact-us","price":"AED 8,000"}]}]
6:["$","$L16",null,{"heding":"Our Ecommerce Website Development Services","subheding":"At Website Development Agency, we are the best E-commerce web design & development agency in Dubai, offering a full-suite of E-commerce website development services, from initial design through to ongoing support, in the UAE.","services":[{"title":"Custom Website Design","desc":"We want your e-commerce website to tell your brands unique story. Our design team creates custom mobile-first ecommerce websites that look visually stunning and resonate with your brand persona while delivering an intuitive and smooth customer experience.","img":{"src":"/_next/static/media/Custom-Ecommerce-Website-Design.8a265753.webp","width":1256,"height":600,"blurWidth":8,"blurHeight":4,"blurDataURL":"data:image/webp;base64,"},"alt":"Custom Ecommerce Website Design Services - Website Development Agency","btnname":"Contact Us","link":"/contact-us"},{"title":"E-commerce Website Development","desc":"We focus on creating websites that are scalable, secure, and optimized for performance, whether developing Shopify, Magento, or WooCommerce. For businesses with more complex needs, we offer custom ecommerce development services with features like multi-vendor shops and advanced integrations.","img":{"src":"/_next/static/media/Ecommerce-Website-Development.66dca79a.webp","width":1256,"height":600,"blurWidth":8,"blurHeight":4,"blurDataURL":"data:image/webp;base64,"},"alt":"Ecommerce Website Development Services - Website Development Agency","btnname":"Contact Us","link":"/contact-us"},{"title":"Payment Gateway Integration","desc":"We make payments easy and secure by building in all the major payment processors—such as PayPal, Stripe, and Apple Pay, and accepting UAE banks and digital wallet options. Every transaction is PCI DSS compliant, so you can be sure that every exchange is encrypted and trustworthy.","img":{"src":"/_next/static/media/Payment-Gateway-Integration.2c0a9c39.webp","width":1256,"height":600,"blurWidth":8,"blurHeight":4,"blurDataURL":"data:image/webp;base64,"},"alt":"Payment Gateway Integration Services - Website Development Agency","btnname":"Contact Us","link":"/contact-us"},{"title":"Shopping Cart & Checkout Solutions","desc":"Cart abandonment is a significant challenge for any ecommerce transaction, and our goal is to minimize cart abandonment. We build checkout flows and user-friendly carts that reduce friction and encourage purchases. Features like guest checkout, pre-filled forms, multiple payment call-outs, and real-time checkout status.","img":{"src":"/_next/static/media/Shopping-Cart-Checkout-Solutions.496c6711.webp","width":1256,"height":600,"blurWidth":8,"blurHeight":4,"blurDataURL":"data:image/webp;base64,"},"alt":"Shopping Cart & Checkout Development Services - Website Development Agency","btnname":"Contact Us","link":"/contact-us"},{"title":"Product Catalog Management","desc":"Whether you are selling 50 products or managing a 50,000+ inventory, our systems will assist you in managing your catalog. We can quickly and easily upload products, categorize and sort them, and filter them for advanced utilization.","img":{"src":"/_next/static/media/Product-Catalog-Management.325c6495.webp","width":1256,"height":600,"blurWidth":8,"blurHeight":4,"blurDataURL":"data:image/webp;base64,"},"alt":"Product Catalog Design Services - Website Development Agency","btnname":"Contact Us","link":"/contact-us"},{"title":"Mobile Commerce (M-Commerce)","desc":"Since the UAE marketplace acts as a mobile-first audience, having a responsive ecommerce website is essential at this point, and no longer an option. We develop mobile-first ecommerce websites that provide an app-like experience with fast navigation, checkout and responsive on-the-go visuals.","img":{"src":"/_next/static/media/Mobile-Commerce-Development.f206e575.webp","width":1256,"height":600,"blurWidth":8,"blurHeight":4,"blurDataURL":"data:image/webp;base64,"},"alt":"Mobile Commerce Development Services - Website Development Agency","btnname":"Contact Us","link":"/contact-us"},{"title":"Third-Party Integrations","desc":"We assist in building a streamlined operation by integrating your ecommerce store with essential third-party systems. From CRM and ERP tools, to shipping APIs and logistics partners, to marketing automation services, we will ensure you are connected and you have less manual work.","img":{"src":"/_next/static/media/Third-Party-Integrations.3de68d5c.webp","width":1256,"height":600,"blurWidth":8,"blurHeight":4,"blurDataURL":"data:image/webp;base64,"},"alt":"Third-Party Integration Services - Website Development Agency","btnname":"Contact Us","link":"/contact-us"},{"title":"Maintenance & Support","desc":"Your E-commerce journey does not end after launch and neither does our dedication to you.  We offer post-launch maintenance, performance monitoring, bug fixes, feature improvements, and regular updates to keep your site performing well and securely.","img":{"src":"/_next/static/media/Maintenance-Support.ae42c78a.webp","width":1256,"height":600,"blurWidth":8,"blurHeight":4,"blurDataURL":"data:image/webp;base64,"},"alt":"Ecommerce Website Maintenance & Support Services - Website Development Agency","btnname":"Contact Us","link":"/contact-us"}]}]
7:["$","div",null,{"className":"frame-1200 pt-100 sm-pt-0 sm-pb-50 sm-px-20","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-center sm-text-start mb-20","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"Features of a Successful Ecommerce Website"}}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-center mb-40 sm-text-start","children":"Creating a beautifully designed site is just the start. To be truly successful in the competitive UAE ecommerce market, your website must be more than just pretty - it has to be fast, secure, easy to use, and conversion-focused. At Website Development Agency, we implement the features that will define your successful, modern ecommerce website in the UAE so your business will draw in visitors and convert them to customers."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"commonThreeCard-module__C821FW__grid","children":[["$","div","0",{"className":"commonThreeCard-module__C821FW__card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"commonThreeCard-module__C821FW__imgbox","children":["$","$L3",null,{"src":{"src":"/_next/static/media/responsive.9a09f8d0.png","width":110,"height":110,"blurWidth":8,"blurHeight":8,"blurDataURL":"data:image/png;base64,"},"alt":"Icon"}]}],["$","h4",null,{"className":"my-15","children":"Attractive & Responsive Design"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Every device your customer uses should be stunning. We design layouts that are responsive to their desktops, tablets, and smartphones so they have an intuitive feel across the board."}],"$undefined"]}],["$","div","1",{"className":"commonThreeCard-module__C821FW__card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"commonThreeCard-module__C821FW__imgbox","children":["$","$L3",null,{"src":{"src":"/_next/static/media/Secure-Transactions.33c36e94.png","width":100,"height":82,"blurWidth":8,"blurHeight":7,"blurDataURL":"data:image/png;base64,"},"alt":"Icon"}]}],["$","h4",null,{"className":"my-15","children":"Secure Transactions"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Trust is everything in ecommerce. All of our websites are secured with SSL encryption, PCI compliant, and secure payment gateways to assure buyers their data and payment are safe."}],"$undefined"]}],["$","div","2",{"className":"commonThreeCard-module__C821FW__card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"commonThreeCard-module__C821FW__imgbox","children":["$","$L3",null,{"src":{"src":"/_next/static/media/Multi-Language.7a01dbec.png","width":110,"height":110,"blurWidth":8,"blurHeight":8,"blurDataURL":"data:image/png;base64,"},"alt":"Icon"}]}],["$","h4",null,{"className":"my-15","children":"Multi-Language & Multi-Currency Support"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"In a country as diverse as the UAE, this is crucial. We integrate multi-language/multi-currency features to your store to make shopping easy for locals, expats, and/or international shoppers alike."}],"$undefined"]}],"$L17","$L18","$L19","$L1a","$L1b","$L1c"]}]]}]
